WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.510 --> 00:00:02.960
Hi, Mystery Recapped here.

00:00:02.960 --> 00:00:09.760
Today I am going to explain the 2015 Drama
Sci-Fi short film called “Getting Fat In

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:11.190
A Healthy Way.”

00:00:11.190 --> 00:00:12.710
Spoilers ahead!

00:00:12.710 --> 00:00:20.850
Watch out and take care!

00:00:20.850 --> 00:00:26.740
The movie starts as a fat man and his lean
wife are outdoors with their child, Constantine,

00:00:26.740 --> 00:00:28.140
for a dry picnic.

00:00:28.140 --> 00:00:32.879
While they are swinging Constantine on their
hands happily, the wife notices a towel flying

00:00:32.879 --> 00:00:33.960
to the sky.

00:00:33.960 --> 00:00:37.449
Suddenly, the gravity stops working at once.

00:00:37.449 --> 00:00:40.579
Everything except for the fat man starts floating
up to the sky.

00:00:40.579 --> 00:00:42.969
The wife and the boy also start floating up.

00:00:42.969 --> 00:00:47.909
The fat man grabs his son, and the son’s
hand is chained with his mother's in the air.

00:00:47.909 --> 00:00:53.459
However, the mother puts on a good-bye face
and relinquishes her son’s hand in the air.

00:00:53.459 --> 00:00:58.679
Devastated, the fat man is in utter disbelief
as his wife flies high in the sky.

00:00:58.679 --> 00:01:04.199
As he pulls his son and hugs him tightly,
he wakes up from his dream with a heavy breath.

00:01:04.199 --> 00:01:09.150
This is a true incident that Constantine’s
father faced 20 years ago after the earth’s

00:01:09.150 --> 00:01:14.260
gravity and the moon’s shape were affected
by a devastating American aircraft accident.

00:01:14.260 --> 00:01:19.940
Due to the accident, the world entered a dystopia
where anything weighing less than 120 kilograms

00:01:19.940 --> 00:01:21.590
flies up in space.

00:01:21.590 --> 00:01:26.500
Next, we get a view of the disturbing shape
of the moon above a set of apartments.

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:29.500
Constantine and his father are having their
food in the kitchen.

00:01:29.500 --> 00:01:34.160
The table is attached to the wall through
a bracket and a gravity meter is working inside

00:01:34.160 --> 00:01:36.760
the house, making sure everything is in check.

00:01:36.760 --> 00:01:39.560
The bookshelf is also seen caged with a fence.

00:01:39.560 --> 00:01:44.230
A man on television talks about the day being
the marking of the 20th anniversary of the

00:01:44.230 --> 00:01:47.670
unfortunate mission of the American shuttle
NEW LAND.

00:01:47.670 --> 00:01:52.300
He informs that the anniversary of the accident
falls on the full moon and alerts that there

00:01:52.300 --> 00:01:55.310
are high chances of damage to the naked eye.

00:01:55.310 --> 00:02:00.159
As the TV man asks all the viewers to maintain
a minute of silence for the memory of those

00:02:00.159 --> 00:02:05.630
who perished in the accident, a large sound
is heard in the room, which shocks the father-son

00:02:05.630 --> 00:02:06.630
duo.

00:02:06.630 --> 00:02:09.590
Soon, the plates and the food start flying
to the ceiling.

00:02:09.590 --> 00:02:12.530
Constantine struggles to hold his hand on
the table while his body floats in the air.

00:02:12.530 --> 00:02:17.530
Despite his best efforts, he loses his grip
and rises to the ceiling in an instant.

00:02:17.530 --> 00:02:21.420
Constantine’s father curses the fuses and
goes to the Gravity machine.

00:02:21.420 --> 00:02:26.239
He rotates a knob and alerts Constantine that
he is going to switch on the machine.

00:02:26.239 --> 00:02:30.709
As Constantine closes his eyes and prepares
for the fall, the machine starts.

00:02:30.709 --> 00:02:34.849
The father covers his head with his hands
as the pieces of stuff flown to the ceiling

00:02:34.849 --> 00:02:36.150
start falling.

00:02:36.150 --> 00:02:39.370
Constantine cries in pain as he thuds to the
ground.

00:02:39.370 --> 00:02:42.409
The father then puts a photo of his wife back
on the wall.

00:02:42.409 --> 00:02:46.650
He asks if Constantine is alright, while Constantine
checks his aching body.

00:02:46.650 --> 00:02:50.859
Later, Constantine’s father checks his weight
in the weighing machine and discovers it to

00:02:50.859 --> 00:02:53.560
be a little more than 120 kg.

00:02:53.560 --> 00:02:58.639
He gets worried that if his weight drops to
less than 120 kg, he will become helpless

00:02:58.639 --> 00:02:59.639
like his son.

00:02:59.639 --> 00:03:04.079
Then, he carries a spherical metal ball marking
20 kg in his bag.

00:03:04.079 --> 00:03:08.230
He informs Constantine that the coffee is
on the table as he flies to work.

00:03:08.230 --> 00:03:12.950
As Constantine is always behind four walls
for his lesser weight, he takes a binocular

00:03:12.950 --> 00:03:17.099
and watches through the window to the streets.

00:03:17.099 --> 00:03:22.560
He finds a man in a military uniform holding
a floating bag with his hand.

00:03:22.560 --> 00:03:26.599
He then sees his father talking to two fat
women who are apparently walking their dogs

00:03:26.599 --> 00:03:28.200
on floating leashes.

00:03:28.200 --> 00:03:32.370
At the other apartment, he notices a woman
throwing a musical instrument at a man on

00:03:32.370 --> 00:03:35.060
the ground but it floats back to her again.

00:03:35.060 --> 00:03:39.749
One of the women on the street starts gossiping
about Constantine’s father torturing Constantine

00:03:39.749 --> 00:03:41.140
for not letting him out.

00:03:41.140 --> 00:03:43.980
She suggests that he can come out with a rope
tied to him.

00:03:43.980 --> 00:03:46.930
As they talk, their floating dogs bark louder.

00:03:46.930 --> 00:03:51.409
Tired of being at home and envious of the
fact that he can’t go out, Constantine tries

00:03:51.409 --> 00:03:53.449
his best to live a normal life.

00:03:53.449 --> 00:03:56.469
He plays a cassette of the sea with the sounds
of waves.

00:03:56.469 --> 00:03:59.349
He then opens up an umbrella and covers the
sofa with it.

00:03:59.349 --> 00:04:01.840
He focuses the light on one of the sofas.

00:04:01.840 --> 00:04:06.419
He undresses his layers of clothes and the
pillow from his body, which he uses to shield

00:04:06.419 --> 00:04:09.030
his body against the gravity fluctuations.

00:04:09.030 --> 00:04:14.349
He then puts on the sunglasses, lotion and
starts sunbathing.

00:04:14.349 --> 00:04:20.530
Later, Constantine gets up and goes to the
window after hearing the honking of a vehicle.

00:04:20.530 --> 00:04:24.220
A cute and chubby lady walks out of the vehicle
and looks up.

00:04:24.220 --> 00:04:29.390
As Constantine gazes at her through the binoculars,
she unties her hair which flies up and she

00:04:29.390 --> 00:04:30.700
waves her hand at him.

00:04:30.700 --> 00:04:35.550
Constantine immediately feels shy as he hasn’t
had any interaction with women since birth.

00:04:35.550 --> 00:04:39.910
He puts on his clothes along with his pillow
and writes down ‘Hello’ on a chart.

00:04:39.910 --> 00:04:47.500
He then stands up to show it to her but backs
out at the final moment.

00:04:47.500 --> 00:04:51.970
After his father arrives home from work, Constantine
serves him food that he cooked.

00:04:51.970 --> 00:04:54.980
His father notices the apron and tells him
that it is for women.

00:04:54.980 --> 00:04:58.980
Constantine replies that it is unisexual.

00:04:58.980 --> 00:05:03.750
The father exclaims it belonged to his mother
and suggests he put it back in its place.

00:05:03.750 --> 00:05:06.970
Constantine obliges and then returns to his
table.

00:05:06.970 --> 00:05:10.410
The father again checks his weight in the
machine again before heading out.

00:05:10.410 --> 00:05:14.470
He sighs with frustration as it gets nearer
to 120 kg.

00:05:14.470 --> 00:05:17.950
Constantine peeps through the door hole and
confirms his father has gone.

00:05:17.950 --> 00:05:21.280
Then, he collects the adult magazines and
selects one of them.

00:05:21.280 --> 00:05:25.160
Constantine covers himself with the blankets
to dive into the excitement.

00:05:25.160 --> 00:05:27.910
He imagines the girl from the van playing
swing.

00:05:27.910 --> 00:05:32.470
Suddenly, Constantine gets disturbed as the
magazine falls to the ground with a sound.

00:05:32.470 --> 00:05:36.350
He picks it up and finds the page titled “Getting
fat in a healthy way.”

00:05:36.350 --> 00:05:40.720
He looks at the advertisement of the Burger
which states that with good food, one can

00:05:40.720 --> 00:05:43.560
easily gain 120-kg weight.

00:05:43.560 --> 00:05:48.410
After the advertisement convinces him, Constantine
orders a huge number of burgers and starts

00:05:48.410 --> 00:05:49.560
having them.

00:05:49.560 --> 00:05:54.370
After eating, he checks his weight and becomes
happy at finding it to be more than 60 kg.

00:05:54.370 --> 00:05:58.500
Meanwhile, he hears the vehicle honking and
quickly writes his name on the chart paper.

00:05:58.500 --> 00:06:03.630
As the girl of his dreams walks down the vehicle,
he shows the chart through the window glass.

00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:06.970
The girl looks at it and waves her hand to
Constantine.

00:06:06.970 --> 00:06:11.390
After his magical encounter, Constantine starts
finishing his remaining burgers.

00:06:11.390 --> 00:06:14.410
Despite having difficulty in swallowing them,
he does not give up.

00:06:14.410 --> 00:06:18.060
He pushes the burgers down his stomach and
finally finishes them off.

00:06:18.060 --> 00:06:20.560
Soon, he feels uncomfortable.

00:06:20.560 --> 00:06:25.220
The father receives a phone call stating that
Constantine has suffered from food poisoning.

00:06:25.220 --> 00:06:26.800
He hurries home quickly.

00:06:26.800 --> 00:06:31.170
As he arrives, he sees Constantine sick in
his bed while the medical personnel prepare

00:06:31.170 --> 00:06:32.170
to leave.

00:06:32.170 --> 00:06:36.720
Later at the kitchen, Constantine finds a
note written by his father over the fridge

00:06:36.720 --> 00:06:40.820
which states not to forget his promise while
his father is flying to work.

00:06:40.820 --> 00:06:45.940
Constantine checks his weight and gets disgusted
at finding it to be around 50 kg.

00:06:45.940 --> 00:06:50.470
He puts some pillows inside his dress and
sits to write something in the chart, dedicating

00:06:50.470 --> 00:06:51.650
it to the girl.

00:06:51.650 --> 00:06:56.060
Down, the girl looks at Constantine’s room
but doesn't find him there.

00:06:56.060 --> 00:07:01.840
Frustrated by his life, Constantine tries
his best to go out.

00:07:01.840 --> 00:07:06.170
He binds himself with a fridge and pushes
it hard to make it to the door.

00:07:06.170 --> 00:07:09.330
As he is about to leave, his father enters
the house back from the office.

00:07:09.330 --> 00:07:13.030
He pushes the fridge back to the room with
Constantine still over it.

00:07:13.030 --> 00:07:17.460
The father then transports all the machines
and heavy equipment from the room, as a precaution.

00:07:17.460 --> 00:07:22.400
Constantine gets annoyed upon not being able
to express his love to the girl.

00:07:22.400 --> 00:07:26.960
The father comes into his room and finds everything
torn and thrown to the ground.

00:07:26.960 --> 00:07:31.150
He goes back to his room and sits at his table
to work on a pair of shoes.

00:07:31.150 --> 00:07:33.520
After working, he falls asleep in the chair.

00:07:33.520 --> 00:07:38.330
He dreams of his son leaving the grasp of
his hand and flying up the sky.

00:07:38.330 --> 00:07:40.670
His eyes open with shock on seeing this.

00:07:40.670 --> 00:07:45.230
When he wakes, he finds his wife’s photos
and other small stuff stuck in the ceiling

00:07:45.230 --> 00:07:47.730
due to the faulty fuse of the gravity machine.

00:07:47.730 --> 00:07:50.990
However, he notices that the shoes did not
fly up.

00:07:50.990 --> 00:07:54.590
He throws them from a height and notices them
falling downwards.

00:07:54.590 --> 00:07:58.580
The father then switches on the gravity machine
and everything stuck to the ceiling falls

00:07:58.580 --> 00:07:59.580
to his head.

00:07:59.580 --> 00:08:03.520
When Constantine comes to the kitchen the
next day, the father brings the pair of shoes

00:08:03.520 --> 00:08:04.990
and puts them on the table.

00:08:04.990 --> 00:08:06.730
Constantine comments that they are ladies’
shoes.

00:08:06.730 --> 00:08:12.920
The father replies that the shoes are unisexual.

00:08:12.920 --> 00:08:16.610
Constantine slowly puts on the shoes and carries
a bag of metallic weights, while his father

00:08:16.610 --> 00:08:17.610
looks on proudly.

00:08:17.610 --> 00:08:18.730
He then turns the Gravity machine off.

00:08:18.730 --> 00:08:22.700
But this time Constantine doesn’t float,
which makes both of them happy.

00:08:22.700 --> 00:08:27.460
Constantine then moves to the ground outside
the apartment with the shoes and bags on.

00:08:27.460 --> 00:08:29.340
His father watches him from the window.

00:08:29.340 --> 00:08:31.620
He heads towards the apartment ahead.

00:08:31.620 --> 00:08:35.170
The girl from the van is watching him from
the balcony of her room.

00:08:35.170 --> 00:08:38.130
He reaches below her apartment and looks at
her up.

00:08:38.130 --> 00:08:42.450
All of a sudden, he shuts off the power of
the shoes, despite his father screaming not

00:08:42.450 --> 00:08:43.450
to do so.

00:08:43.450 --> 00:08:47.510
Constantine then throws his bag away and takes
out the pillow from his body too.

00:08:47.510 --> 00:08:50.510
He closes his eyes and keeps on rising upward.

00:08:50.510 --> 00:08:55.590
However, he feels someone’s hand grasping
his shoulder and not letting him go any higher.

00:08:55.590 --> 00:09:02.950
Constantine smiles as he sees the girl he
loves in front of her smiling back at him.

00:09:02.950 --> 00:09:08.070
After watching the events unfold, Constantine’s
father winks at the photo of his wife.

00:09:08.070 --> 00:09:10.930
At the end of the movie, the radio floats
up in the sky.

00:09:10.930 --> 00:09:15.880
The man on the radio welcomes their surprise
guest, an American astronaut ‘Dusan Pradic',

00:09:15.880 --> 00:09:17.830
and asks him to say a few words.

00:09:17.830 --> 00:09:22.320
The astronaut who was also a part of the fatal
accident, starts with an apology.

00:09:22.320 --> 00:09:27.570
He then announces that the world will probably
never recover from the dystopia they put into.

